<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!--
    RUT_RustCathedral                              UtinniPatches - authored 2026-09-09
    BIOME_OWNERSHIP_WAVE_1. Full sheet: design/Jawa/worldbuilding/biomes/
    the_rust_cathedral.md (FROZEN). Replaces the donor `AB_MechanoidIntrusion`
    (Alpha Biomes). THE LORE IS PARTITIONED on this sheet (SS0): only SSP
    (player-facing) content informs anything here; SSGM truths never appear in a def
    field, matching hard ban 1.

    MEASURED (sheet SS0): 236 tiles, one region, at the substellar doorstep — arc
    median 10.7 (sun +79 deg, the highest steady sun on the planet), temp median
    62.5 C, the flattest ground anywhere (211/236 tiles dead flat at ~616 m).

    plantDensity zeroed and hasVirtualPlants false: ban 7 is explicit — "No
    ordinary wildlife... green flora count: zero." animalDensity dropped to near-zero
    (0.1, donor's own value): SS4 "almost nothing, and each exception is a story" —
    the roster is 3 named exceptions (mynock flocks, coolant eels, living bolts), not
    a normal wildlife curve. allowRoads FALSE: ban 4 "No organic settlement or
    faction presence but road traffic" — read narrowly, only the droids' own "No
    Master" seat keeps a road OUT (SS8), so roads are not a biome-wide feature here;
    flagged as a judgment call, not a named field-level ban.

    diseases trimmed to the two mechanite entries only (dropped Flu/Plague/etc. and
    BMT_Disease_Mutapox): "remote from organics" (SS4) argues against a normal
    epidemiology; the mechanite pair is the one disease register that fits a
    mechanoid-garrisoned plateau.

    Weather: no rain/fog per the "no erosion engine at all... near-zero humidity"
    driving force (SS3); Clear and shimmer-appropriate DryThunderstorm dominate.

    wildAnimals/wildPlants: transplanted from BiomeCast_Ashkarr.xml /
    BiomeFlora_Ashkarr.xml against rosters/the_rust_cathedral.json — ONE entry
    (Ling_Cockroach, the roster-flagged candidate SS4 names for grading) and ZERO
    flora rows respectively (BiomeFlora_Ashkarr.xml carries none for this defName —
    left empty rather than invented, matching ban 7's "green flora count: zero").

    NOT this pass's scope: `RUST_CATHEDRAL_MECHANICS_1` (hum-mood system, the living
    bolts as mechanical wildlife, eel-fishing consequences, wall-tier defs); the
    canon-sitting naming propagation (Forsakens=Rakatans=Ancients); any world
    repaint.

  -->

  <BiomeDef>
    <defName>RUT_RustCathedral</defName>
    <label>the Rust Cathedral</label>
    <description>A flat plateau of deck plate and mathematical walls at the foot of the eternal noon -- a complex, circuit-board maze of walls and structures that screams of meaningful complexity and intention. Rust-dust banks in drifts against them, heat shimmer stands as the weather, and almost nothing living remains. And under everything, always, a hum.</description>
    <workerClass>AlphaBiomes.BiomeWorker_MechanoidIntrusion</workerClass>
    <hasVirtualPlants>false</hasVirtualPlants>
    <lakeBeachTerrain>AB_SoilOnCrackedMetal</lakeBeachTerrain>
    <mudTerrain>AB_SoilOnCrackedMetal</mudTerrain>
    <riverbankTerrain>AB_SoilOnCrackedMetal</riverbankTerrain>
    <allowRoads>false</allowRoads>
    <allowRivers>true</allowRivers>
    <allowFarmingCamps>false</allowFarmingCamps>
    <animalDensity>0.1</animalDensity>
    <plantDensity>0.0</plantDensity>
    <forageability>0.0</forageability>
    <movementDifficulty>1.5</movementDifficulty>
    <texture>Biomes/AB_MechanoidBiome</texture>
    <diseaseMtbDays>90</diseaseMtbDays>
    <diseases>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>Disease_FibrousMechanites</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>100</commonality>
      </li>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>Disease_SensoryMechanites</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>100</commonality>
      </li>
    </diseases>
    <terrainsByFertility>
      <li>
        <terrain>GU_MetalFloor1</terrain>
        <min>-999</min>
        <max>999</max>
      </li>
    </terrainsByFertility>
    <baseWeatherCommonalities>
      <Clear>90</Clear>
      <DryThunderstorm>4</DryThunderstorm>
      <Fog>0</Fog>
      <Rain>0</Rain>
      <RainyThunderstorm>0</RainyThunderstorm>
      <FoggyRain>0</FoggyRain>
      <SnowGentle>0</SnowGentle>
      <SnowHard>0</SnowHard>
    </baseWeatherCommonalities>
    <wildAnimals>
      <Ling_Cockroach MayRequire="lingluo.cockroach">0.05</Ling_Cockroach>  <!-- Giant Cockroach - medium, import -->
    </wildAnimals>
    <coastalWildAnimals />
    <wildPlants>

    </wildPlants>
    <wildPlantRegrowDays>25</wildPlantRegrowDays>
  </BiomeDef>

</Defs>
